{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2022-08-02 10:06:00', 'title': 'EIGHT AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL ADVISORS NAMED TO THE FORBES BEST-IN-STATE FINANCIAL SECURITY PROFESSIONALS LIST', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT EIGHT OF THE FIRM'S FINANCIAL ADVISORS WERE NAMED TO THE FORBES LIST OF THE “BEST-IN-STATE FINANCIAL SECURITY PROFESSIONALS” IN THE COUNTRY. FORBES RECOGNIZES THE TOP FINANCIAL ADVISORS AND PROFESSIONALS IN THE INSURANCE INDUSTRY FOR THEIR EXCELLENCE IN HELPING CLIENTS PROTECT AGAINST THE FINANCIAL RISKS POSED BY DISABILITY, DEATH, OR JOB LOSS. THE RANKINGS ARE BASED ON DATA PROVIDED BY THOUSANDS OF THE NATION'S MOST"}